Add a generated `tsvector` column combining `name` (weight A) and `description` (weight B), a GIN index on it, and query with `websearch_to_tsquery`, ranked by `ts_rank`:

```sql
ALTER TABLE products ADD COLUMN search_vector tsvector
  GENERATED ALWAYS AS (
    setweight(to_tsvector('english', name), 'A') ||
    setweight(to_tsvector('english', coalesce(description, '')), 'B')
  ) STORED;

